{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8c852ad5b715e968397e3392be279c407436f21b2824ef2487fd959b49b620e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:388c05d66910da290e1dc9f0316027a86ccdbd1fff7b2259ff8b92bfc39c9ce1",
      "text": "优等生迈向未知的一步",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca8d00256521a50331dc5de22a070b79f48368dd4eb0489829cf6cdde0ab84c4",
      "text": "3人通过了歌唱和舞蹈的审查，开始为了出道\n而展开练习。然而即便待在同一个\n空间，某种尴尬的气氛依旧挥之不去。\n就在复杂的情感互相交织的状态下，\n第一份工作敲定了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:388c05d66910da290e1dc9f0316027a86ccdbd1fff7b2259ff8b92bfc39c9ce1",
      "text": "优等生迈向未知的一步",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a6e90bff2e780e30fadd0b5213cae77206cf8e924d3e68abf0264acb5ba0305",
      "text": "1、2、3、4……\n热身运动这样就差不多了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb8c97868435151eb780ec725643523a457255d155596b80dd10dbdfae4beebd",
      "text": "（……昨天也是练习，今天也是练习。\n请对方过目我们的歌声和舞蹈的那时候……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f58c752767742b80747834dab592a83d8ac603e499add3a30b7b166e65fee44f",
      "text": "……非常感谢！\n3个人的歌声和舞蹈都超乎想象的精彩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d149c7aa15c3e255bf23e0e77893c49530aba523dafb8745c1c7bf3920bf762a",
      "text": "我已经能看到大家作为偶像站上舞台，\n闪闪发光的身姿了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f286d190e00e971a4fa6025739890d5be83bda0b5621c3fec3aff0d85f95f5a6",
      "text": "（……明明把我们夸上了天。\n我们的日程表却一直都只有“练习”而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db5ccb9b9b49c6ef6b32a500b9ab1c037cf4a57078a77327825abba1f7738ebf",
      "text": "……嘛，反正我的目标可是世界级的水平。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a40063ffc2e27184877c2862dcdfd5d442e91f144811bd7af10705a4f037b9",
      "text": "趁着现在还有时间，\n打牢基础也是很重要的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14e2f6c651ba4b10653141c1d352d302b4e8055f4177499fd2b9e2e80e20cb67",
      "text": "早上好，天峰君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:509a249a6be3e96f9a6ebe54ec9a7a7386baba4af0a65acfed2cdbbdb60957f0",
      "text": "百百人前辈。早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75275a088802a299964f96eadfb7bb32a98383a3cc5d6bd536a3ef88d6aef78d",
      "text": "……P酱，果然还是没来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de2bdb881fabda76e0c398774b5ea563d45e2f5690abdd3705b3b468eb04b3c3",
      "text": "是的。他今天说要去跑业务，\n应该不会来这里吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e52f54a1be4a0d685d6c8fbb6b72355bc1eb771829986410651aa8b542ba9f0",
      "text": "这样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_a:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec390171807d709d38e759fc83b5976f75f37fdbdd8f0dff8102dea5faae6c93",
      "text": "呐。在练习开始之前，能聊聊吗？\n我是听●●●●●●●●●●P酱说的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9190acdd92bb9e8fe12e7bbdf56c286a725b0ce76c7587f628f6c708e5fdb0a4",
      "text": "推荐我和眉见君来当偶像的人，\n其实是天峰君，这是真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e34e6d2ddcce3edecda40bdb86a97f987b020aa2a864b612c8654274addfca",
      "text": "啊，是的。因为在被制作人发掘之后，\n他问我有没有想要一起组队的人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3dee109f9fc967cec5d7bc313916cd0ef6c36f56c3f5d7767c4d8f6d70aea3",
      "text": "所以我就提到了“著名学生会长”中被称为“最强”的锐心前辈，\n还有“奖项杀手”百百人前辈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e133c035fc4d42595483c9bee4d08ba17b6cc5a853ad726ce8f5e553c950edb1",
      "text": "我觉得换成那两个人，大概就能跟\n身为“一年级学生会长”的我并驾齐驱了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7b432d8abfe0a9c91eb513b2b766829f2dc21738136953f63ef5e19e1dc1e62",
      "text": "哈哈哈……我也被高估得太过了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54df8506071269530111ce98b04b78488a0c86404b8a23c90e77bbbea8919738",
      "text": "……奖项杀手拿到的，都只是些半吊子的奖而已。\n我可没有厉害到能和你或是眉见君并肩的地步哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f34a71be4171c80f59f253ef9120c7eef5789b78f54ed27e407f3ca2a68409ea",
      "text": "（但是……这次一定要变得和你们一样才行。\n如果在这家事务所也被当成残次品抛弃的话）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed2878dc12360eea9a760fbb672f03e64e69462e7b628e24c7339f1ccd341185",
      "text": "那……天峰君，\n是怎么被P酱发掘的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:217cb54f0485158265602c5f0bab57f395d89ec306981c8e6d0535d321f79247",
      "text": "差不多就是哼着歌的时候，被对方看中了\n这样的感觉吧。就像这样。……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e06d5da960c3388e78425d3040319e099cf952a70844852c00dfa1c99755daa6",
      "text": "音乐和唱歌算是我的兴趣，\n不过我自己也会搞作曲和编曲之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a045b260939f4b7ba74620bb4fcd33c0729494ca52c185983ea9d557e2d3ea3b",
      "text": "我把作品上传到网上，也有自己的粉丝哦。\n要是这方面的事情，尽管期待我就好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e87972cccf40ea706c3f72d03b673835aa83812147e28ba4befad60697e0c535",
      "text": "原来是这样，真厉害啊。\n……此外擅长的事情还有很多吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1228b12ada856b020c4f4a58fc97a93b8f4d7e611d8617f87044d1a110ec4e31",
      "text": "嗯～……嘛，大部分的事情都难不倒我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11303fc291d36f2249fc4071695dc47cd1b5cf3e52a3fa7565ec90f4a244b436",
      "text": "基础的功课自然不用说，连体育也是\n到了会被运动部的家伙们拜托去当外援的程度……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8e2926911ef8a19a4a0b6cb067fab3e057d2db74865827866f52356878278b1",
      "text": "……？怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18194e6bc4ce16792df537d20aa667ada443bfc7383faf8e345b641d0345c8ba",
      "text": "（……刚才，百百人前辈……露出了可怕的表情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4aee62d157b304e4db2714886cf2e36e990ebb008a0610a0ec745b292088f5b7",
      "text": "（……明明气氛很温柔，也主动搭话聊了好多。\n这个人，心里到底在想什么啊……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aec2f529887f276a2f89a9ca914df3d1b8e246bc408d4d55244de383a4dfca1",
      "text": "早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fd6871ba08b9ce1b65f6cf78a3d3193579fc589b1325a8f55cf466589c7c8a8",
      "text": "啊，早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b71a024d0b9b39cd43da7cc72d31c98056bacb2c4368a1e87c5e55bbb1d3de01",
      "text": "早上好。\n哎呀，对眉见君来说今天算来得晚的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1647cf46e7a2152b04db56ced192f308c32f73746d8b322c6a72fd82f3ad55ee",
      "text": "嗯。做这个花了点时间，\n导致出门晚了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0979d66b56175edb90fd17c8c7dcf31fb17b8fcf252375a1f6ca0555dfe114cf",
      "text": "那个是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97e8d6df3f246b88294f2e0c63b74893e28e9d6a4369525dbda954c6a90d4a37",
      "text": "我们现在，不是还有可以自由支配的时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb0a2bb1634316c1af4817266ea8b7021ee8ccf5aa86b13c8df6abedd5516682",
      "text": "我就把趁这段时间作为新人偶像应当学习、\n掌握的事情整理成了清单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7015624cbed4d36afbcd1c8cfcbf86db6bf02e08d171b00dd02b1852c2fdf31",
      "text": "虽然只是在我的预料范围内，\n但也考虑到了偶像可能会被委派的工作倾向。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a48706f0617dbc1d680d9cfd0277406dedf5ff5ca573a791d1f59cec156c182",
      "text": "诶，真的假的？\n其实我也整理了差不多的资料过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67f0fcfcf538b275dc1321b2d474e06be55cbe90a3092bb7f00df2009e8aa7c4",
      "text": "我们很合得来呢，锐心前辈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e3abeb0a7f488a118872569cf614b70483267ab0bff87ac299bbf0df86c6ae",
      "text": "嚯，真有意思。可以借我看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e0a1db15eb7c1a446ee5b440b372ab7b30f30afd1b368a5fec145e87053bde0",
      "text": "当然可以。锐心前辈的那份，也能给我看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d73d836e8672abbf5974342a4a53b9e0a011f30430c2b09ea43df02cfbeace33",
      "text": "（……哇，太通俗易懂了吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:607d14bcc210604f0e8ca0ff2d2b80246ecdf81e3a07e1a09bb0d6a31e2ee704",
      "text": "（啊～这样啊。这里比起文字还是用图表\n更容易装进脑子里呢……下次我也这么做吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8910977564546dde4b85fede232ac0295102b0d70f4661401a711c660c279500",
      "text": "（不仅是被动等待指示，\n还能自己主动推进工作吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_d:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e7a18d80a4ba1e6a502e47ffc3b9e8dcec700e939fe033d6f4ec17aa6265ed0",
      "text": "（……能以一年级生当上学生会长，确实令人信服）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2081f38c435fef33f42a881d169de1b8255e01b9ceaf128160f418bb89ab2958",
      "text": "……好。今天就先到这里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:053b62521761228ec5ccb0cb4cfd4ad199a836d822f6c219b54b19b0caa27b38",
      "text": "明天的开始时间，\n已经从制作人那里听说了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f003fd161f1b01ca9b697684204d5417aded19b44ca4b4ed168e8f31cc90802",
      "text": "是的。听说会帮我们增加歌唱练习呢。\n我已经开始期待了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ad85055017234dd4054c211fdac2d36d6a812c1b1c720596d887130c81fef85",
      "text": "（……在下次练习之前，我也得准备点什么才行。\n不能跟他们两个人拿一样的东西，必须拿出在此之上的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000085:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4200ec0b8eae31e0e875596f30cd85ab0ca39bc9975df396f554bc3c39628522",
      "text": "秀的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e08a5fcc63713809c01cae18126da5c23a12c1e732c8a8686fc743dc9926010c",
      "text": "嗯，好吃。嚼嚼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27f955bbcd6a869db0c80d1588811b88f91002d7bbf1b729b0445ddc5568b062",
      "text": "多吃点哦。\n努力了一整天，肚子肯定饿坏了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9820900b4fc88703e0a1dc4512dc4854f7e9c7e07adf4cce7faa56cbd1e99d6",
      "text": "最近在学校怎么样啊？秀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d6e29d340d23cce3ceae74026250bb1e99c27b3f2077d00e5669d410b99b8d",
      "text": "嘛，还是老样子。……啊，这个也好好吃。\n我说这个菜，明天的份还有剩吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d56248ab4a64735197a80d88161b3658f0b7b85b012e4d6c80015a95970a543c",
      "text": "有啊，多着呢。\n那么，除了学校之外，当偶像那边也顺利吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb6dbe533bfa44e7ebe012195781a53fe2f041debefe33e2f9a89db5bc0dd1b3",
      "text": "诶？啊啊，那边的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4873828a2fec64395a7956e762c9694ae1c913686d2e29d898baef23f92c5d13",
      "text": "……有个感觉有点吓人、\n让人搞不懂的前辈在啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42fcd17ce7f3b6273670f3e536300c875ecf4cae7ffe46e9766e5d1b7a03b258",
      "text": "倒也不是被对方做了什么就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ae3d0a314baf9229c0353b7e9f1ed1289272056582d045400bf240c37557be",
      "text": "（……难道说，是我做了什么吗？\n在不知不觉中伤到了对方，所以被拉开距离了也说不定……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a455e11e7692ee738311c78f282a510917f1dd4c019d011b6400156331e23cf7",
      "text": "（……没错，在那家伙的时候也是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edfc38d52dc0ca8fe3722752ee733bfc27d3bb5c23a2aa23935af67d3528b4fc",
      "text": "…………\n啊——，真是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e967bc8225ed88bc4ffab075e92ccb99a5bc5d9b24eeb74b1d0d60d8fd81bbe",
      "text": "哎呀，突然怎么了。别大喊大叫的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a4e680e9092eec3772c6de63a64c2fdab1b79050628e9d35a91c2cbf8dcceb6",
      "text": "对、对不起。没什么。\n我要再盛一碗，把那个盘子递给我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0765f55cb22793dc437bbf0dea8e60e1a51c1bf3ae46fc6fb27aa77b517342aa",
      "text": "（……我这个大笨蛋！\n为了无法挽回的事意志消沉，又能顶什么用啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ffa750a1b8137e388be75eded43501f05563540e588b330f45514ab09d7c11c",
      "text": "（与其磨磨蹭蹭地后悔，不如向前看。\n把自己的脑子和时间资源，拿去为了未来而使用啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1482abe446a636970b5c6652b256399739f10389b76bcfbfa773c3d11d70f2f",
      "text": "（天峰秀，这次一定要拯救那家伙对吧？\n通过制作人给我的，名为偶像的这条新道路）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_f:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da4aa635b69882c064d49a934473207cfc8728b98af65e7e3296461b67ccfb6",
      "text": "（身为天才，可别做无用功啊！笨蛋！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14a6c3493a75ea71a9925f66cfe7c5baa82b2c302b53554f91f3e0c7d376a442",
      "text": "两杯咖啡。……百百人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c13755e73cf4e9aa2af318fb096a35b31feb6ee6559732cc5e4693611415d25",
      "text": "去练习之前，要不要在这里稍微聊聊。\n我请客。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21f8dbc847b26f9c4574506330387d91aee5cadefeba69925c8a7027a27e44ab",
      "text": "诶……什么啊，为什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5469184a97412e0b578087ad8fdd95706600484f99a2c55917892e8b53d086d4",
      "text": "……昨天的练习中，\n你一副闷闷不乐的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:232ef3b1e45f2befa55918ad9b2087a4d25ec2c7ae8358af3a80fe687a5e5666",
      "text": "啊啊……讨厌啦，被你发现了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:935400a4a83fa1ebab41a8e631f9e974d7474f6a74e8e69b44cfa39128719425",
      "text": "我和秀所做的事，\n你没有必要感到自卑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6d502f2da61d2eb06d01c1266641b4c5aef834a29edab26e1fdc41c13fe2ea1",
      "text": "那不过是我们为了带动自己的组合，\n擅自去做的而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e27c0609435f7444ad8c120d7f1d2495955e1a235819ad5b99244218c56128",
      "text": "……所以这次，又连情绪低落的成员\n也一并关照到了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7482179e2c961f9cb5b030998f21988f1c16162fad4dbcec24e7c95d0d98f4b",
      "text": "明明只比我大了一岁，\n眉见君也未免太全能了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_g:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb6931f077b293557da9182e74197b823961a7c29b282a2653d43e16f017af3d",
      "text": "被你这么一安慰，我可能反而更加消沉了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0f0b5f8733d19ab86cafb5077f6d0a3e72a0d57483fd32ce475c3b290c3e478",
      "text": "果然，百百人很可靠啊。\n我平时都没能考虑到这一层。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a178eb82df0b7bb968206ab6af81b8a2ec88d86fd82e2d99d641504247dc0d2",
      "text": "从讨人喜欢的你看来，今后\n若是我有什么不足之处，还请随时指出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c95f1496a2b820c26d0cf7c451409c52a072b01f70698c6d69dfc05938be8e3",
      "text": "为了将我们的组合引向更高峰，\n像你这样有能力的伙伴是不可或缺的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61816d6b445980d097e6bc1946c55a67b24052f2de07953c841bcb6caaa817a5",
      "text": "……首先，我擅自挑的咖啡\n合不合你的胃口，能告诉我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d275ab570a662227eaf35003124d099a55a4a3acaf3058de20485370d3e24ef",
      "text": "如果想喝更甜的，我就重新去点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f13cac81205e4c52b1da39700c70205a217eb856d987e0371bbe8fe32217b66e",
      "text": "……谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cefd0c9e9758b5b9ec646e58805b55514c5e2900f50e4125f39d2357d49caac8",
      "text": "（这个人……简直到难以置信的程度，太“完美”了。\n倒不如说正因为太完美了，一切看起来都像“谎言”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e05ebf3f0dc069d82f63ff32c7084a2e1ce4fab92bea9671c9b363437e248476",
      "text": "（你这人……心里真正的想法到底是什么呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc4993d9d7b8c7c713eb88ba872fb601a24f10f451968ba818955fca96db30ff",
      "text": "（难道跟我一样……也是什么，都没有拥有的吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:355e6956b9ca27c6b5cf0fd9e4b8fb9ad6f518057727fd30079973461adf1414",
      "text": "各位，C.FIRST的第一份工作定下来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdde8fafcb17a5ef10010deee8de046ff483aac53aa47f7de87cf0bb2cea47b8",
      "text": "虽然今后还要推敲细节，不过总之，\n我先向各位说明目前已经确定下来的内容吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b98cb1973ab97811719535fe2b7a39b3fa631872ab25d790423a1d440eee5a",
      "text": "终于定了吗？\n太慢了啦，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca7a034a70ae563e687179ddceec281746c3c6f066bbd9bd3e5df66c6ddf9462",
      "text": "会是什么样的工作呢。\n好期待啊，也有些小紧张呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b05311190bbf30dd6ac79a28cfb370da20794a631db30105236c99b9218c0a1",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，麻烦你说明了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:104ea734bfe2a963877eae40a9b75eb05dd97891f10eba632dd3da683c246a2f",
      "text": "……以上就是全部内容。在工作期间，如果有不懂的事情、\n感到困扰的事，随时都可以找我商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe35b9e33448f295af7fa1073c8903f7d786f444a3da512f99054122596b6f8b",
      "text": "315 Production和我这个制作人，\n一定会全力支持大家的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:756088e9b43dede3560820ab5086b42b3db45d9f26ac429051f8fed39fdd70a7",
      "text": "……还挺会说让人安心的话嘛。\n谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c69ead4bdfce25a0988945261970e41c3d42c26bb7b5fdebf397ffeb8f2f2976",
      "text": "呵呵，感觉好温馨啊。\n……总觉得，就像是拥有了新的家和家人一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b809ef299bd1aab391decf6f67f69f1f10de2a1e6e3631dc1bae5f446e94d5a5",
      "text": "（……家人……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e337c10e4560cbd15ca3bbd28fd5df1b83134f04243ac7f383204aba2afbddf9",
      "text": "我希望那孩子，能连同弟弟的那份一起自由地生活。\n所以……、呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36408bb3da65d9ef5f2332ec7205175876f6875e7f0a2401e9377b371a8aff6",
      "text": "别哭。只要有我们在，锐心就没事的。\n好了。把那个收起来，今晚早点休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8cf94b2a230b3f63117ba3afd086f0f1010cab13e26d8e12b87cdf0f0f7c3df",
      "text": "那，明天也拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0927caa23a3a959335f33f436ec4b1ee7c57642d277daa809f947c51c10f207c",
      "text": "辛苦大家了。\n回头见咯，●●●●●●●●●●P酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a03f72bd4642adcb43e674617b49a23a841eddd4b5f0d87ca77cf2e6be1974d1",
      "text": "那么，我也告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f56deb5dd45d68b8cdd4d7123fc04e4cbc0b4965c3131e6ddc3c4dc7c9dde76",
      "text": "那个，锐心先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b315ea0c5b9f0fa55d2bfe797f8aef987afe763b1ba0f6104b2490537e86b6d7",
      "text": "什么事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee900ec46159ff483ba302540106076e51a74988a29ee7a75ba6f2c786ce328a",
      "text": "……刚才在说明的时候，不知是不是我的错觉，\n感觉锐心先生的表情阴沉了下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfd4ef4394c0cce5d7c9c46ff1ab8b427af9bbdd0535c110c22824b46b06211b",
      "text": "要是有什么我们能做到的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2bbd6b841c18557c47d335c9d52e1ff86f1454cc48fe9ebe664420c8fc99173",
      "text": "什么都没有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1a25edad3ec7f83779d896b8880ee1aacef871dd0234073874470b108cd8184",
      "text": "……你只要负责判断，我是否具备作为偶像的资质，\n仅仅做好这一件事就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:786e87ae9dc8160b7c1b9c3410825c921e5c8c0628717aa1e8d4b594159ced65",
      "text": "我们……今后共同活动的时间还会增加。\n正因如此，才应当保持适当的距离。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:388915c29f6de1da5c681ac17047f74806a1cb7679ff3b7f99de177449735d66",
      "text": "……不必插手多余的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_04_1_1_016_04:1_1_016_04_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdba5c4a973c689bafb9ffa4b6db6213218fa9ab46f2310448ec1fdff2a24d5b",
      "text": "（拜托了。……你绝对不要，对我倾注任何关爱）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
